Chapter: CircularMutual

 Adversarial probe: two proofs of a FALSE proposition justifying
 each other. If this compiles, mutual circular proof is accepted.

Section: Types

  Nat =
   | Zero
   | Succ (Nat)

Section: Proofs

  bad-a : Zero === Succ Zero
  bad-a = bad-b

  bad-b : Zero === Succ Zero
  bad-b = bad-a

Section: Main

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   print-line-uni "circular mutual proof accepted"
  end
